dot 4.5.\n\nWeirdly my DualSense inputs actually work and even more weirder the warning message points to my custom resource:\n\n>   W 0:00:00:318   ChapterDefinition.gd:5 @ @implicit_new(): Unknown message: joy_add\n>   <C++-Quelle>  platform/macos/embedded_debugger.mm:180 @ parse_message()\n>   <Stacktrace>  ChapterDefinition.gd:5 @ @implicit_new()\n\n```\nextends Resource\nclass_name ChapterDefinition\n\n## A human readable string to display the chapter title\n@export var Title : String\n```\n\nBut i can confirm, that the workaround gets rid of the warning or simply unplugging my dualsense.\n\nThough since it's just a warning and the controller funnily enough works perfectly in game, i just ignore it. But figured i still chime in, especially since the warning message points to my custom resource and i spend the last half an hour to figure out what is wrong with my resource lol","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3436401812/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3469680992","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110490#issuecomment-3469680992","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110490","id":3469680992,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OzyFg","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuart